<title>UK: Abbey Nat'l up as Laing repeats buy stance.</title>
<headline>Abbey Nat'l up as Laing repeats buy stance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Abbey National rose on Wednesday after Credit Lyonnis Laing repeated a buy recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1054 GMT, the shares were 15-1/2p higher at 652-1/2p, the highest level in more than nine months.</p>
<p>Analysts at Laing could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
